@@ -143,6 +143,10 @@ Settings › Talk & listen › FM broadcast step, `radio_settings_t.bcast_step`,
 
 Either way any frequency can be typed in: 90.2 is tuned and heard as entered.
 
+A broadcast VFO band scan follows the configured grid, including the wrap at the band edge. It waits up to 200 ms
+for the tuner to report that it has reached each frequency. The scan compares that frequency's RSSI against the
+squelch threshold on the first valid reading. Where the radio also receives the air band, the scan stays below it.
+
 ### 4.5 Board glue
 
 The HR_C7000 boards share one composition, `platform/hrc7000/bcast_hrc.c` (`hrc_bcast_init`): the RDA5807M driver on
